## Quick start

```sh
mise install   # just, gitleaks and actionlint at the pinned versions (.mise.toml)
[% if visibility == 'private' %]
just hooks     # once per clone: gitleaks runs before every push
[% endif %]
just ci        # [% if python %]unit tests, [% endif %]workflow lint and secret scan, the same as CI
```

## Layout

| Path | What |
|---|---|
| `project.yaml` | project card: name, area, status, stack, highlights, links, visibility |
| `CLAUDE.md` | agent notes; the workspace rules in `ecosys` apply |
| `.github/workflows/` | `ci` (jobs[% if python %] `test`,[% endif %] `gitleaks`, `actionlint`, aggregate `ci-result`) and `pr-title` |
[% if visibility == 'private' %]
| `.githooks/pre-push` | gitleaks on the commits being pushed; fails closed |
[% endif %]
[% if python %]
| `tests/` | unit tests (`unittest`, stdlib only) |
[% endif %]
| `.copier-answers.yml` | answers for `copier update` from `tmpl-project`; do not edit by hand |

